 "notes": "Every clip is built from keyframes hand-finished at native size in pets/species/gato/keys/*.txt (the GPT sprite-gen run in .dream-loop/pets/gato/sprite-gen is only the reference): front sit, front stand, back, side stand, side sit, groom, sniff (front and side), scratch, bat, loaf, lie, belly-up, curled sleep, stretch (arch and play-bow), crouch, leap and run. Every loop is one keyframe plus what moves: walks lift the legs in turn (each leg keeps its outline), resting poses breathe by widening the chest or raising the back 1 px, happy swishes the tail, look-down moves only the pupils, blink/yawn/knead change only eyes, mouth or paws, scratch drags only the raised forepaws. carry-left is the walk with a 3x2 open jaw (the runtime draws the ball there). The default cinza wears the Koncluí collar: a teal band and one bright tag. Extra clips beyond the quadruped set: run-left, carry-left, bat-left, sniff-down, sniff-left, scratch-left, knead-down, loaf-down, blink-down, roll-any. One-shots (loop false): stretch-left, pounce-left, yawn-down, roll-any, blink-down. happy-down is the petting reaction.",
